    "body": "## Summary\n- extend finance reconciliation so Stripe ledger health includes persisted settlement purpose/business-reference integrity\n- require `JOB_PUBLICATION` claims to remain bound to the matching `job_publications` row and reject top-up claims that are attached to publication PaymentIntents\n- extend payments-ledger smoke with a deliberate settlement-identity corruption and recovery check\n- document the new reconciliation invariant\n\n## Why\nPR #101 made Stripe settlement identity durable in `payment_transactions`. The finance health check still validated only wallet/amount/currency correspondence, so a corrupted or manually altered purpose/reference could remain invisible operationally. This slice makes that commercial identity part of reconciliation.\n\n## Migration\nNo new Flyway migration. Uses the V41 columns merged in #101.\n\n## Validation\nLatest-head CI/checks must be green before merge; do not merge while pending or failing.",
